  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "User story",
      "items": [
        "As a modeler I want a Kimball warehouse designed from the real sources and KPIs, so that engineering gets validated DDL and mappings instead of drawings and spreadsheets.",
        "Actions: set up the warehouse, let staging generate, ask the assistant for Core and Mart, review and accept the Change Set, map columns, approve each Layer, export.",
        "Outcome: an approved DW Schema with column-level lineage, a quality score and a DDL package."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "System behaviour (verified)",
      "items": [
        "Staging is made by software (stg_<system>_<schema>_<table>, direct mappings), re-synced after every new Snapshot as a Change Set.",
        "AI output is never applied directly: generate_dw_schema and draft_mappings end in a Change Set; the model never sees ids (handles).",
        "Mapping SQL is parsed with sqlglot on save and lineage edges are derived from it.",
        "Every committed design change rescores the warehouse (debounced) and revokes an approval of the changed Layer."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Errors and branches",
      "items": [
        "Accept: stale items (the field moved since proposal) and their dependents are skipped; owner-only items wait as needs_owner; a closed Change Set is 409.",
        "Approve: 409 score_gate_failed (errors, or below the minimum), core_not_approved (Mart before Core), approver_is_last_editor (when required).",
        "Edits carry a version: a stale one is 409 version_conflict. SQL that does not parse is saved with an error and no lineage."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Simplified",
      "items": [
        "Direct edits in the model editor (model_service.py) are an alternative to the AI path; they also trigger propagation.",
        "AI evaluation (evaluate_dw) and the mapping sheet export/import are not drawn.",
        "A regeneration offer after source or KPI changes restarts the AI path (regeneration.py)."
      ]
    }
  ]
